# arm32 vectors of the extend group (Thumb-2 code): the state after each case of
# cases/extend.cases under qemu-arm-static (-cpu max) over 3 states a case, written by
# write_arm32_vectors in crates/ra-asm-lift/tests/vectors/arm32.rs and replayed by its arm32 test.
# case <kind> <bytes> <assembly> <- <template>; in: the registers the case sets (the rest are
# zero), the flags as NZCV bits, the window of data bytes; out: where the case stopped and
# what it changed.
case Extend 50b2 sxtb r0, r2 <- sxtb {Ld}, {Lm}
in nzcv=1000 r0=0x80000007 r2=0x7fffffff
out pc=0x30002002 sig=trap r0=0xffffffff
case Extend 50b2 sxtb r0, r2 <- sxtb {Ld}, {Lm}
